BOSSgram compact/showid hooks v3 (DrKLO/Telegram master, Oct 2026).
Native ports of plugin-need (see docs/PLUGINS.md): compacttext, showid.
All logic in com.bossgram.modules.*; single lines here only.
Anchors verified against upstream master 12.10.6 (7112).
On reject: re-anchor the single added line, keep everything else.

v3 fixes (showid never displayed):
- ChatAvatarContainer: updateSubtitle() writes newSubtitle DIRECTLY into the
  views, setSubtitle() is NOT on that path. Hook the finalized newSubtitle
  instead (setSubtitle hook kept for the direct-call path, e.g. business link).
- ProfileActivity: updateProfileData has TWO name/status loops (user branch +
  chat branch); the chat branch sets status text AFTER the user branch, so the
  hook must live in both loop bodies.

